<div class="note warn">
    <span class="nh">Facts and estimates</span>
    The <strong>design intent</strong> of these mechanisms (transparency, verification, relocation, compute destruction) is confirmed by public materials. Whether they <strong>could actually work</strong>, however — the political realism of the US and China agreeing to place their nations' core compute in indefensible locations, and the completeness of verification — is heavily <a href="#!news-20260709-ai-2040-reactions">contested</a>.
</div>

